 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under '1. Starting7': Hidden Base / Systems Will Slip Through Your Fingers, Rendezvous Point (posted 'Ren. Point'), a 'Marker', Heading For The Medical Frigate (posted 'Heading for the frigate'), Staging Areas, Insurrection and Strike Planning; they count toward the total. Several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set.",
  "Posted 'Marker' names no card: it is the planet system the Hidden Base objective uses as its marker, but the post does not say which system, so it is printed as written.",
  "Posted 'Hasshn' dested Major Haash'n (Light pilot; the strategy uses him with Home One against TIEs).",
  "Posted 'Grand moff wedge leader' dested Wedge Antilles, Red Squadron Leader ('Grand moff' is not part of any Light card name; 'wedge leader' fits only Red Squadron Leader).",
  "Posted 'OOC/Trans Term' = Out Of Commission & Transmission Terminated; 'Courage of sky' = Courage Of A Skywalker; 'Clash' = Clash Of Sabers; 'The Bithe Shuffle/Desperate Reach' = The Bith Shuffle & Desperate Reach; 'Control/TV' = Control & Tunnel Vision; 'Your Insight' = Your Insight Serves You Well; 'Han w/gun' = Han With Heavy Blaster Pistol; 'Leia w/gun' = Leia With Blaster Rifle; 'Endor docking bay' = Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay); 'Tatooine DB' = Tatooine: Docking Bay 94.",
  "The list header 'Hidden Base Mains Deck' and the section header '1. Starting7' were parsed as cards and removed.",
  "Posted 'Weapon Lev' dested Weapon Levitation (Jabba's Palace), the Light printing; 'Dagobah' = Dagobah (Light).",
  "Total as published: 60. The strategy says to swap the third Our Most Desperate Hour for Home One; the list is kept as published."
